@startuml HomeShield Sequence Diagram - Fall
title HomeShield - Sequence Diagram\n"Person falls -> Fall alert reaches browser"

skinparam sequenceArrowColor #1E40AF
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #92400E
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FEF3C7

actor "User\n(browser)" as User
participant "Flask Server" as Server
participant "CaptureWorker" as Worker
participant "CameraPipeline" as Pipe
participant "Models\n(YOLO pose)" as Pose
participant "FallStateMachine\n(7-state FSM)" as FSM
participant "ZoneStore" as Zones
participant "EventBus" as Bus
database "SQLite" as DB
collections "SSE clients" as SSE

User -> Server : open /dashboard
Server --> User : HTML + JS
User -> Server : EventSource /events_stream
note over User, Server : Browser keeps SSE connection open

loop every frame for camera 1
    Worker -> Pipe : process_frame(frame)
    Pipe -> Pose : track(frame)
    Pose --> Pipe : keypoints + bboxes
    Pipe -> FSM : step(result, H, W, ts)
    FSM --> Pipe : persons[] with current state
end

== Critical moment: STANDING -> FALL_DETECTED ==

Pipe -> FSM : step(result)
FSM -> FSM : compute peak descent velocity\n(body-units per second)
FSM -> FSM : compute trunk angle\n(shoulder->hip vector vs vertical)
note right of FSM
  Two-stage rule:
    A) velocity > impact threshold
    B) trunk_angle > 60 degrees
       held for >= 0.5 s
  Both must fire to leave STANDING.
end note
FSM --> Pipe : person.state = FALL_DETECTED

Pipe -> Zones : is_in_safe_zone(cam=1, foot.x, foot.y)
Zones --> Pipe : false (not on sofa/bed)

Pipe -> Pipe : Cooldown OK? yes
Pipe -> Pipe : Build Event(\n  type='fall_detected',\n  camera_id=1,\n  confidence=0.80,\n  bbox=...,\n  meta={person_id, fsm_state})

Pipe -> Bus : publish(event, frame)
Bus -> Bus : daemon worker wakes
Bus -> Bus : draw 'FALL' badge on snapshot
Bus -> DB : INSERT INTO events
DB --> Bus : event_id = 73
Bus -> SSE : SSE 'event' payload
SSE --> User : data: {event_id:73, type:'fall_detected', ...}

User -> User : Toast "Fall detected on Living Room"
User -> Server : GET /snapshots/...fall_detected.jpg
Server --> User : annotated JPEG
User -> User : Append entry to live event log

@enduml
